---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
---

<Layout title="send">
  <p class="small-label fade-up">Commands</p>
  <h1 class="fade-up d1">send</h1>

  <h2>Usage</h2>
  <CodeBlock>
    <code>junkyard send [file...]</code>
  </CodeBlock>

  <h2>Flags</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Flag</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>--json</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Emit newline-delimited JSON events</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--no-color</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Disable color and Unicode borders</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--qr</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Show the QR code panel</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--quiet</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Print only the short code</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>--ttl</code></td><td><code>1h</code></td><td>Time to live, capped at 24h</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Example</h2>
  <CodeBlock>
    <code>junkyard send file.zip</code>
  </CodeBlock>

  <h2>Exit codes</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>0</code></td><td>success</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>1</code></td><td>generic error</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>2</code></td><td>invalid arguments</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>3</code></td><td>network error</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>4</code></td><td>code expired or not found</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>5</code></td><td>user cancelled</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Passing multiple files zips them automatically before upload.</li>
    <li>Codes are generated with <code>crypto/rand</code>, never <code>math/rand</code>.</li>
    <li>File chunks are encrypted by the client before upload. The relay receives the short code used to derive the key, so this is not end-to-end protection from the relay operator.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>